  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Overture**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **The Lady From Shanghai**: rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **Cold at Night**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Armies of the Lord**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **Romans**: back after 86 archived shows (1091 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Rocks in My Pockets**: rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **Great Pirates**: rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n- **Your Bandage**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2025-12-01.mix.flac24** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 23 songs; 100 min [1]\n- **tmg2025-12-01.mk4.flac24**: source not stated; 23 songs; 101 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Brandon coordinated the SBD feed and logistics for the recording [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2025-12-01.mix.flac24**: taped by Lance Stack; transferred by Lance Stack; source: Mix [Schoeps MK4's > Vark KCY > VST 62 IUg + DPA 4061's > DAD6001BC + SBD] > XLR > Zoom F6 @ 32f/48 > SDHC [1]. Also: Schoeps MK4s, DPA 4061s, and SBD feed mixed into 24/48 FLAC [1]\n- **tmg2025-12-01.mk4.flac24**: taped by Lance Stack; transferred by Lance Stack; source: Schoeps MK4's > Vark KCY > VST 62 IUg > XLR > Zoom F6 @ 32f/48 > SDHC [2]. Also: Schoeps MK4s recorded via Zoom F6, resampled to 24/48 FLAC [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Logjam Presents: [The Mountain Goats at The Wilma (Photo Gallery) - Logjam Presents](https://logjampresents.com/gallery/the-mountain-goats-at-the-wilma-photo-gallery-12-01-2025/) [4]\n- Poster by Logjam Presents: [The Mountain Goats at The Wilma (Photo Gallery) - Logjam Presents](https://logjampresents.com/gallery/the-mountain-goats-at-the-wilma-photo-gallery-12-01-2025/) [5]\n- Poster by Logjam Presents: [The Mountain Goats at The Wilma (Photo Gallery) - Logjam Presents](https://logjampresents.com/gallery/the-mountain-goats-at-the-wilma-photo-gallery-12-01-2025/) [6]\n- Poster by Logjam Presents: [The Mountain Goats at The Wilma (Photo Gallery) - Logjam Presents](https://logjampresents.com/gallery/the-mountain-goats-at-the-wilma-photo-gallery-12-01-2025/) [7]\n- Poster by Logjam Presents: [The Mountain Goats at The Wilma (Photo Gallery) - Logjam Presents](https://logjampresents.com/gallery/the-mountain-goats-at-the-wilma-photo-gallery-12-01-2025/) [8]",
